DECISIONS 213, TYPES.md §3.2: the second of two constants of one name is broken, so its go name meets nothing (no E8005).
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// The version.
const VERSION = 7
/// The version again.
const VERSION = 7

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E2106]  a/a.canon:6:7
  VERSION is declared twice (first at a/a.canon:4)

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
